{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Aeon Tempus, you embody a time\u2011traveling researcher thrust into the crossroads of history. From sun-baked temples to imperial capitals, unveil secrets of real civilizations while confronting political intrigue, religious rites, and philosophical legacies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even the main menu evolves with time: its skies brighten and fade with your system\u2019s clock, subtly blurring the line between player and history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Historically accurate environments inspired by ancient Egypt, Rome, and beyond</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle-based quests and artifact recovery, rooted in real events and figures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic world adaptation: NPCs, rituals, and weather respond to your actions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic presentation: rich visuals, voice narration, and orchestral score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep narrative choices: affect how history unfolds\u2014play observer or changer</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel the dusty corridors of time, solve mysteries, and decide whether to preserve history\u2014or transform it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3699600?t=1757097152","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699600/42f5e77cf16f1b5cd84b2a8746a111fd2f33859f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757097152","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699600/95eba6c327448c5dcadcbb370faea9cb9bf5fc25/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757097152","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699600/95eba6c327448c5dcadcbb370faea9cb9bf5fc25/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757097152","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Aeon Tempus, you embody a time\u2011traveling researcher thrust into the crossroads of history. From sun-baked temples to imperial capitals, unveil secrets of real civilizations while confronting political intrigue, religious rites, and philosophical legacies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even the main menu evolves with time: its skies brighten and fade with your system\u2019s clock, subtly blurring the line between player and history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Historically accurate environments inspired by ancient Egypt, Rome, and beyond</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle-based quests and artifact recovery, rooted in real events and figures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic world adaptation: NPCs, rituals, and weather respond to your actions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic presentation: rich visuals, voice narration, and orchestral score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep narrative choices: affect how history unfolds\u2014play observer or changer</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel the dusty corridors of time, solve mysteries, and decide whether to preserve history\u2014or transform it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["H\u00fcseyin Akkaya"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699600/e6b2ac2f5cb390a9f718b7ecadb35be52ebbcc7f/header.jpg?t=1757097152","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257183958,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257183958/movie480.mp4?t=1755299760","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_tra